- entry .Shrunk   a closed world of classfiles: the toolchain node reached from `Classfile` through `shrinkEdges`
+ entry .Shrunk   um mundo fechado de classfiles: o nó da toolchain alcançado a partir de `Classfile` por `shrinkEdges`

= entry .Shrunk   a closed world of classfiles: the toolchain node reached from `Classfile` through `shrinkEdges`
-   detail
+   detail

-       An `Artifact.Ir` with id `shrunk`: a directory which is a classpath of its own, holding
-       the classes the entry points reach, the resources of the libraries which gave them, and
-       no TASTy.
-   entry .Jar   an executable JAR of a closed world: the application node reached from `Shrunk`
-       An `Artifact.Application` with id `shrunk-jar`. It is a node of its own, and not
-       `Artifact.Jar`, so that a toolchain which has both `jarEdges` and `shrinkEdges` has one
-       path to each.
+       Um `Artifact.Ir` com id `shrunk`: um diretório que é um classpath por si só, contendo as
+       classes que os pontos de entrada alcançam, os recursos das bibliotecas que as forneceram, e
+       nenhum TASTy.
+   entry .Jar   um JAR executável de um mundo fechado: o nó de aplicação alcançado a partir de `Shrunk`
+       Um `Artifact.Application` com id `shrunk-jar`. É um nó próprio, e não `Artifact.Jar`, para
+       que uma toolchain que tenha tanto `jarEdges` quanto `shrinkEdges` tenha um caminho para cada.

- entry .shrinkEdges   the edges which make shrinking a step of a toolchain
+ entry .shrinkEdges   as arestas que fazem da redução um passo de uma toolchain

= entry .shrinkEdges   the edges which make shrinking a step of a toolchain
-   detail
+   detail

-       `shrinkEdges(scalac)` registers two edges: from `Toolchain.Universe.Classfile` to
-       `Shrunk`, and from `Shrunk` to `Shrunk.Jar`. The first carries the options of the
-       `Scalac` which compiled the classes, since it compiles them again, and takes the
-       toolchain's entry points as the roots of what is kept. The second packages the closed
-       world as `jarEdges` packages a classpath, with at most one entry point as its
-       `Main-Class`.
+       `shrinkEdges(scalac)` registra duas arestas: de `Toolchain.Universe.Classfile` para
+       `Shrunk`, e de `Shrunk` para `Shrunk.Jar`. A primeira carrega as opções do `Scalac` que
+       compilou as classes, já que as compila de novo, e toma os pontos de entrada da toolchain
+       como as raízes do que é mantido. A segunda empacota o mundo fechado como `jarEdges` empacota
+       um classpath, com no máximo um ponto de entrada como seu `Main-Class`.

=       `Main-Class`.
